{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">鑽石山有人懷疑持刀遊蕩，警方深夜在慈正邨正暉樓一個單位將涉案女子拘捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事女子被指曾在慈雲山慈正邨一帶出現，周日晚上10時許，有警員手持盾牌戒備，並帶同爆破工具上樓。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.KNIFE-0230_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hnISuGG5oU1791149255.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.KNIFE-0230_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在晚上近7時，警方接獲港鐵職員報案，指發現一名女子在鑽石山站大堂遊蕩，懷疑手持一把生果刀，之後走往荷里活廣場小巴站方向。到凌晨一時許，警方爆門進入正暉樓一個單位，將涉案女子拘捕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.KNIFE-0230_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ghCxIX35LK1791149210.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.KNIFE-0230_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">據了解，該名女子被捕期間有反抗，清醒送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。警員之後在港鐵站尋獲涉案生果刀。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T21:57:06.646666+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}